# Header rules for the central dashboard SPA (Cloudflare Workers Assets).
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/headers/
#
# Same rationale as the tenant web/public/_headers: static assets (the SPA HTML
# shell) are served directly by Workers Assets, BYPASSING the Worker, so the
# central Worker's security-headers middleware never runs for the HTML document.
# The CSP must be delivered here to land on the page. Keep this policy in sync
# with CONTENT_SECURITY_POLICY in shared/securityHeaders.ts (a test enforces it).
# CSP is report-only during rollout; flip to Content-Security-Policy to enforce.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; img-src 'self' data:; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com; connect-src 'self'; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'
